A communication-principle is relevant during a shorter-duration-opioid-discontinuation.
A pain-management-principle is relevant during a shorter-duration-opioid-discontinuation.
A behavioral-support-principle is relevant during a shorter-duration-opioid-discontinuation.
A slower-taper-principle is relevant during a shorter-duration-opioid-discontinuation.
If there is a recommendation-5 and there is a long-term-opioid-therapy and there is a subacute-pain then the recommendation-5 applies during the long-term-opioid-therapy for the subacute-pain.
If there is a recommendation-5 and there is a long-term-opioid-therapy and there is a chronic-pain then the recommendation-5 applies during the long-term-opioid-therapy for the chronic-pain.
